OL,9,     Ffrom a possible drug overdose to a
OL,10,     Fmosh pit injury is possible.
OL,11,G0000 Emergency: First Time Medics
OL,12,     FChristine handles a mysterious
OL,13,     Ffall case, Adrian learns how to
OL,14,     Fset a broken ankle, Alex helps a
OL,15,     Fchild who's been hit by a car, and
OL,16,     FClaire deals with a woman with
OL,17,     Fagonising chest pain.
